    <string name="wellbeing_sugg_movement_1">Stretch your arms, legs, and back for a minute.</string>
    <string name="wellbeing_sugg_movement_2">Do a few jumping jacks or stretches to reset.</string>
    <string name="wellbeing_sugg_movement_3">Dance to a favorite song for a few minutes.</string>
    <string name="wellbeing_sugg_movement_4">Take a short walk around your home.</string>
    <string name="wellbeing_sugg_movement_5">Try a few simple, gentle stretches.</string>

